<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - XPEDITE CUT TO HOLD.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - XPEDITE CUT TO HOLD.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities downgraded Xpedite Systems Inc to hold from buy, a Prudential source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Xpedite gained 5/8 to 22-1/4.</p>
</text>
